Package: ntlpanel
Type: Package
Title: Nighttime Lights to Analysis-Ready Panels for Econometrics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Serik", "Iskakov", email = "s.iskakov@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns satellite nighttime lights products (NASA Black Marble
    from Suomi NPP 'VNP46' and NOAA-20 'VJ146', Earth Observation Group
    VIIRS Nighttime Lights, and harmonized DMSP-VIIRS series) into balanced
    unit-by-period panels for econometric analysis. Every observation
    carries coverage and quality diagnostics. The package provides
    documented cross-sensor splicing, explicit rules for high-latitude
    summer gaps, crosswalks between administrative boundary vintages and
    distance-ring treatment exposure.
